[HEADING=1][DD] New Post Icon[/HEADING]

[B][DD] New Post Icon[/B] is a specialized UI enhancement for XenForo designed to improve user navigation by visually highlighting new, unread content within thread lists.

[HEADING=2]Features[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]Smart Status Indicators[/B]: Automatically places a visual icon before the title of any unread thread.
[*][B]State Awareness[/B]: The icon is only displayed for threads containing content the specific user has not seen yet.
[*][B]Custom Icons[/B]: Choose any icon from the FontAwesome library (e.g., fa-certificate, fa-star, fa-bolt).
[*][B]Style-Specific Customization[/B]: Define different icons or colors for each of your styles (e.g., specific looks for Light vs. Dark themes).
[*][B]Zero CSS Required[/B]: Colors and icon classes are configured directly in the ACP—no manual editing of extra.less is necessary.
[*][B]Lightweight Architecture[/B]: Designed with a minimal footprint to ensure no impact on page load speeds.
[*][B]Seamless Integration[/B]: Uses clean template modifications for thread_list_macros to ensure compatibility with other UI add-ons.
[/LIST>

[HEADING=2]Requirements[/HEADING]
[LIST]
[*][B]XenForo[/B]: 2.3.0 or higher
[*][B]PHP[/B]: 8.2.0 or higher
[*][B]Dependency[/B]: [URL='https://forum.dice-dragons.de/'][DD] Core AddOn[/URL] (v1.4.2+)
[/LIST]

